n| 11 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, sign/whitespace/leading-zero shapes: `\"+2\"`, `\"-0\"`, `\"+0\"`, `\"0000\"`, `\" 7\"`, `\"\\t-4\"`, `\"\\n\\v\\f\\r 12\"`, `\"   +000123\"` *(rand)* | `cfg_whitespace_sign_zeros` | [x] |\n| 12 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, valid prefix + trailing garbage: `\"5abc\"`, `\"0x10\"`, `\"3 4\"`, `\"7\\n\"`, `\"12.\"`, `\"9,9\"` *(rand suffixes)* | `cfg_trailing_garbage` | [x] |\n| 13 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, digit-count sweep 1…19 digits, both signs *(rand)* | `cfg_digit_count_sweep` | [x] |\n| 14 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, 20…200 digit runs (far past `LONG_MAX`, exercises the saturation loop) *(rand)* | `cfg_long_digit_runs` | [x] |\n| 15 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, full-range random `i32` strides *(rand, 400 values)* — covers `i * stride` and `sum += …` overflow | `cfg_random_i32_strides` | [x] |\n| 16 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, `int` boundaries `2147483647`, `2147483648`, `-2147483648`, `-2147483649`, `4294967295`, `4294967296` (truncation of `long` → `int`) | `cfg_int_boundaries` | [x] |\n| 17 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, values around `2^31 / 2^32` multiples where truncation yields 0 (`4294967296`, `8589934592`, `-4294967296`) | `cfg_int_boundaries` | [x] |\n| 18 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, `LONG_MAX` exactly (`9223372036854775807`) | `cfg_long_boundaries` | [x] |\n| 19 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, `LONG_MAX + 1` (saturating, `ERANGE` ignored) | `cfg_long_boundaries` | [x] |\n| 20 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, `LONG_MIN` exactly (`-9223372036854775808`) | `cfg_long_boundaries` | [x] |\n| 21 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, `LONG_MIN - 1` (saturating) | `cfg_long_boundaries` | [x] |\n| 22 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, random 64-bit decimal values (in/out of `int` range) *(rand)* | `cfg_random_i64_strings` | [x] |\n| 23 | `EP2`,`EP3` | `argc == 2`, random byte-soup arguments (printable + high-bit bytes, accepted or rejected — whichever the C picks) *(rand, 400 values)* | `cfg_random_byte_soup` | [x] |\n| 24 | `EP2` | `argc == 2`,