ies + symbol parity) covering thousands of differential cases per row with a fixed-seed SplitMix64 generator; every test loads **both** `.so`s via `libloading` (fd 1 `dup2`-captured for `main`) or spawns **both** executables and compares stdout/stderr/exit code/signal byte-for-byte. `./run_diff_tests.sh` enumerates the feature power set (Cargo.toml has no `[features]` → one combination), and runs check/build/`nm -D` diff/tests for it in **both** dev and release (`panic = \"abort\"`) profiles: **ALL CHECKS PASSED**, 0 missing symbols.\n\nSuite sensitivity was proven by four deliberate mutations (clamp-instead-of-truncate, missing `\\v` in the isspace set, removed SIGPIPE restore, thread-local total) — each was caught, then reverted. `VERIFICATION.md` records the gate, the fixes, and the mutation results."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":620,"cache_read_input_tokens":173909,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":620,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8bf0fff8-6e9f-4845-be1f-6a8b3c8a7388","uuid":"fb4c062a-843c-44b2-a3f0-62b417dbdc32","timestamp":"2026-08-17T22:47:38.548Z"}
